, pop... hop! Ahan brings bubbles to class! Timberly helps her students write a song.","duration":26,"scws_id":379204,"season_id":9847,"created_at":"2025-09-27T09:32:01.000000Z","updated_at":"2025-11-05T08:41:49.000000Z","quality":"HD","audio_orig":1,"dub_ita":0,"sub_ita":1,"uploaded_at":"2025-09-27 11:32:01","images":[],"translations":[{"id":361715,"translatable_type":"episode","translatable_id":125014,"locale":"it","key":"name","value":"Episodio 3"}]},{"id":125021,"number":4,"name":"Episodio 4","plot":"Un vero DJ visita la classe per creare musica per il compleanno di Maple. Max e Mia ricevono un nuovo cucciolo. I bambini trascorrono la giornata imparando tutto sulla batteria.","duration":26,"scws_id":379205,"season_id":9847,"created_at":"2025-09-27T09:33:26.000000Z","updated_at":"2025-11-05T08:41:49.000000Z","quality":"HD","audio_orig":1,"dub_ita":0,"sub_ita":1,"uploaded_at":"2025-09-27 11:33:26","images":[],"translations":[{"id":361730,"translatable_type":"episode","translatable_id":125021,"locale":"it","key":"name","value":"Episodio 4"},{"id":361731,"translatable_type":"episode","translatable_id":125021,"locale":"it","key":"plot","value":"Un vero DJ visita la classe per creare musica per il compleanno di Maple. Max e Mia ricevono un nuovo cucciolo. I bambini trascorrono la giornata imparando tutto sulla batteria."}]},{"id":125015,"number":5,"name":"Episodio 5","plot":"The kids learn about instrument families, then get to choose a song for the Rainbow Stage! Bari wants to share his Gran's song with the class.","duration":26,"scws_id":379206,"season_id":9847,"created_at":"2025-09-27T09:32:03.000000Z","updated_at":"2025-11-05T08:41:49.000000Z","quality":"HD","audio_orig":1,"dub_ita":0,"sub_ita":1,"uploaded_at":"2025-09-27 11:32:03","images":[],"translations":[{"id":361716,"translatable_type":"episode","translatable_id":125015,"locale":"it","key":"name","value":"Episodio 5"}]},{"id":125022,"number":6,"name":"Episodio 6","plot":"Ahan's pet fish inspires a lesson abo